  "details": "I have a game suggestion that I think may improve hand tracking feature. In hand tracking mode, it would be really cool if players could take photos with a simple \"finger photo-frame\" gesture. This would allow them to see a mini preview of the photo before taking it. Once they're happy with the preview, they could take the photo by clicking with their pointing finger(like in the video) and save it. (Maybe when changing hands position it could toggle selfie mode and normal camera mode) I think index user should also have this feature",
